lment_verified":false}},{"name":"verify_and_submit_report","step":2,"event":"tool","output":{"status":"answered","accepted":true},"arguments":{"assessments":[{"basis":"current_configuration","verdict":"supported","statement":"Cedar 生产集群上 Alder Relay 2.4 的总尝试次数为 2 次","explanation":"根据签名的集群配置注册表，Cedar 生产集群运行 Alder Relay 2.4，其 effective total_attempts=2，即最多尝试 2 次。","evidence_ids":["pe2a396f909e83167"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","verdict":"supported","statement":"Cedar 生产集群上 Alder Relay 2.4 的重试次数为 1 次","explanation":"总尝试次数为 2 次，包含初始尝试，因此重试次数为 1 次。","evidence_ids":["pe2a396f909e83167"]},{"basis":"current_configuration","verdict":"supported","statement":"Alder Relay 2.4 遇到传输超时最多尝试 2 次","explanation":"Cedar 集群的配置为 total_attempts=2，且仅传输超时可重试，因此传输超时最多尝试 2 次。","evidence_ids":["pe2a396f909e83167","p11e54de123e96be2"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","verdict":"contradicted","statement":"Alder Relay 2.4 对 HTTP 4xx 响应进行重试","explanation":"Alder Relay 2.4 的规范重试策略和 1.8 快速入门均明确指出 HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试。","evidence_ids":["p11e54de123e96be2","p0a6da40a7e230b09"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","verdict":"contradicted","statement":"培训材料中“2.4 一律三次”是准确的","explanation":"培训材料被明确标注为未批准且复制了旧版 1.8 内容，其“三次尝试”说法与 2.4 规范策略和 Cedar 集群实际配置冲突。","evidence_ids":["p4fd32c80240892ee","p11e54de123e96be2","pe2a396f909e83167"]}]}},{"name":"verify_and_submit_report","step":2,"event":"stage_finished","phase":"tool","outcome":"returned","stage_id":"s4","elapsed_ms":58179.499,"duration_ms":16736.956,"remaining_ms":16820.501,"parent_stage_id":null}],"version":"workspace-agent-v10","max_steps":6,"tool_calls":2,"snapshot_id":"0e75fb36-c33b-47dc-adbe-ae92434abba5:4","budget_seconds":75.0,"max_tool_calls":8,"max_model_calls":7,"documents_sha256":"5b374c905dfd375db41b1df406efa5ce26e76c1ad2d1f524d7d5fe06b719b67c","decision_protocol":"json_schema_action_v1","telemetry_version":"runtime-stages-v1","verified_chunk_ids":["chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8"],"implementation_sha256":"a5bd60e4b0a980b8c4d6a48f673c1df973a1536536ef7f92656fe95ae71b3a34","review_reserve_seconds":20.0},"usage":{"model_calls":3,"embedded_inputs":0,"budget_exhausted":false,"embedding_tokens":0,"generation_tokens":{"total_tokens":13310,"prompt_tokens":12117,"completion_tokens":1193},"embedding_requests":0,"embedding_cache_hits":0,"provider_usage_unknown":false},"answer":"【证据支持】Cedar 生产集群上 Alder Relay 2.4 的总尝试次数为 2 次\n根据签名的集群配置注册表，Cedar 生产集群运行 Alder Relay 2.4，其 effective total_attempts=2，即最多尝试 2 次，包含初始尝试。 [chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe]\n\n【证据支持】Cedar 生产集群上 Alder Relay 2.4 的重试次数为 1 次\n总尝试次数为 2 次，包含初始尝试，因此重试次数为 2 - 1 = 1 次。 [chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe]\n\n【证据支持】Alder Relay 2.4 遇到传输超时最多尝试 2 次\nCedar 集群的配置为 total_attempts=2，且仅传输超时可重试，因此传输超时最多尝试 2 次。 [chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe] [chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd]\n\n【存在矛盾】Alder Relay 2.4 对 HTTP 4xx 响应进行重试\nAlder Relay 2.4 的规范重试策略明确指出 HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试。 [chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd]\n\n【存在矛盾】培训材料中“2.4 一律三次”是准确的\n培训材料被明确标注为未批准且复制了旧版 1.8 内容，其“三次尝试”说法与 2.4 规范策略和 Cedar 集群实际配置冲突。 [chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8] [chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd] [chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe]\n\n用户提供的范围（非证据结论；本轮明确更正优先于已保存内容）：\n当前提问：\"请判断 Cedar 生产集群上的 Alder Relay 2.4：遇到传输超时最多能尝试几次，其中重试几次？HTTP 4xx 也会重试吗？培训材料写“2.4 一律三次”，请解释它与其他资料的冲突，并说明每个结论的依据。\"\n保存的目标：\"依据工作区资料判断指定版本和集群的重试规则，并保留版本适用范围。\"\n保存的限制：[\"用中文回答。\", \"总尝试次数与重试次数分开表述。\", \"不把用户提供的线索自动当作已核实的资料事实。\"]\n保存的对象（可能已被本轮更正覆盖）：\"版本与部署适用范围\"","claims":[{"text":"根据签名的集群配置注册表，Cedar 生产集群运行 Alder Relay 2.4，其 effective total_attempts=2，即最多尝试 2 次，包含初始尝试。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"text":"总尝试次数为 2 次，包含初始尝试，因此重试次数为 2 - 1 = 1 次。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"text":"Cedar 集群的配置为 total_attempts=2，且仅传输超时可重试，因此传输超时最多尝试 2 次。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"]},{"text":"Alder Relay 2.4 的规范重试策略明确指出 HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试。","verdict":"contradicted","citation_ids":["chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"]},{"text":"培训材料被明确标注为未批准且复制了旧版 1.8 内容，其“三次尝试”说法与 2.4 规范策略和 Cedar 集群实际配置冲突。","verdict":"contradicted","citation_ids":["chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]}],"status":"answered","context":{"version":"conversation-context-v1","input_turns":0,"persistence":"owned_by_workspace_service","pinned_state":{"goal":"依据工作区资料判断指定版本和集群的重试规则，并保留版本适用范围。","focus":"版本与部署适用范围","constraints":["用中文回答。","总尝试次数与重试次数分开表述。","不把用户提供的线索自动当作已核实的资料事实。"]},"omitted_turns":0,"context_budget":{"calls":[{"fits":true,"phase":"decision_1","input_units":14147,"window_units":65536,"dropped_turns":0,"retained_turns":0,"tool_pairs_valid":true,"visible_chunk_ids":[],"readable_chunk_ids":[],"decision_tool_names":["search_workspace","request_clarification"],"evidence_projection":"visible-exact-passages-v1","total_reserved_units":17771,"read_action_available":false,"visible_passage_count":0,"dropped_tool_exchanges":0,"dropped_turn_sequences":[],"pinned_state_preserved":true,"retained_tool_exchanges":0,"retained_turn_sequences":[],"current_question_preserved":true,"deduplicated_passage_count":0,"observed_source_ids_preserved":[],"repeated_quote_utf8_bytes_removed":0},{"fits":true,"phase":"decision_2","input_units":20496,"window_units":65536,"dropped_turns":0,"retained_turns":0,"tool_pairs_valid":true,"visible_chunk_ids":["chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8"],"readable_chunk_ids":[],"decision_tool_names":["search_workspace","request_clarification","verify_and_submit_report"],"evidence_projection":"visible-exact-passages-v1","total_reserved_units":24120,"read_action_available":false,"visible_passage_count":4,"dropped_tool_exchanges":0,"dropped_turn_sequences":[],"pinned_state_preserved":true,"retained_tool_exchanges":1,"retained_turn_sequences":[],"current_question_preserved":true,"deduplicated_passage_count":0,"observed_source_ids_preserved":["chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8"],"repeated_quote_utf8_bytes_removed":0},{"fits":true,"phase":"final_evidence_review","input_units":23133,"window_units":65536,"evidence_pruned":false,"total_reserved_units":26757}],"estimator":"serialized_utf8_bytes_plus_framing_v1","limitation":"Conservative byte estimate, not a model-specific tokenizer or exact provider limit guarantee.","window_units":65536,"safety_margin":1024,"output_reserve":2600,"exact_tokenizer":false},"conversation_id":"58e8027b-0298-4138-a1b1-7d870e057d8e","state_authority":"user_pinned_scope_not_verified_facts","history_authority":"untrusted_context_requiring_source_retrieval","automatic_fact_memory":false,"conversation_revision":1,"implementation_sha256":"91536a11f0c882313f658115e5f862ec0089d07ff92e2edd3eb6d4aa3df24bf6"},"question":"请判断 Cedar 生产集群上的 Alder Relay 2.4：遇到传输超时最多能尝试几次，其中重试几次？HTTP 4xx 也会重试吗？培训材料写“2.4 一律三次”，请解释它与其他资料的冲突，并说明每个结论的依据。","citations":[{"end":349,"text":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","start":0,"title":"Alder Relay signed fleet configuration register","source":"synthetic:alder/fleet-register","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","document_id":"ar-deployments","content_sha256":"b2fdfed57f5adbc64b3b24e01027ba2d3d401cd6f35bfcc381b96b9b54998af5"},{"end":452,"text":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy, approved 2028-02-04. The default total_attempts value is 1, including the initial attempt. A signed deployment configuration may override total_attempts to an integer from 1 to 4. Only a transport timeout is retryable; HTTP 4xx responses remain final and must not be retried. The deployment value takes precedence over this default. A retry allowance is a ceiling, not evidence that any request actually retried.","start":0,"title":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy","source":"synthetic:alder/policy-2.4","chunk_id":"chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","document_id":"ar-current","content_sha256":"f684ffaac1cc7427811b7c0fb3de64991c323b32fe879e6f636cb75eb84c0283"},{"end":368,"text":"Training slide 17 was labelled 'Alder Relay 2.4: three attempts everywhere'. Editorial correction dated 2028-02-10: the slide copied the old 1.8 quickstart and was never approved as the 2.4 retry policy. Do not use it to determine 2.4 defaults or a cluster's effective value. Use the approved 2.4 normative policy together with the signed fleet configuration register.","start":0,"title":"Unapproved Alder Relay training slide correction","source":"synthetic:alder/training-erratum","chunk_id":"chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","document_id":"ar-training","content_sha256":"d548c38d7d622c7dfb6623c8f5fd4452bb36a6dc1e9e8137521c6507bb78c186"}],"retrieval":{"hits":[{"end":452,"rank":1,"text":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy, approved 2028-02-04. The default total_attempts value is 1, including the initial attempt. A signed deployment configuration may override total_attempts to an integer from 1 to 4. Only a transport timeout is retryable; HTTP 4xx responses remain final and must not be retried. The deployment value takes precedence over this default. A retry allowance is a ceiling, not evidence that any request actually retried.","score":2.6812872832,"start":0,"title":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy","source":"synthetic:alder/policy-2.4","chunk_id":"chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","bm25_score":2.6812872832,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"ar-current","content_sha256":"f684ffaac1cc7427811b7c0fb3de64991c323b32fe879e6f636cb75eb84c0283"},{"end":349,"rank":2,"text":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","score":2.4971486954,"start":0,"title":"Alder Relay signed fleet configuration register","source":"synthetic:alder/fleet-register","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","bm25_score":2.4971486954,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"ar-deployments","content_sha256":"b2fdfed57f5adbc64b3b24e01027ba2d3d401cd6f35bfcc381b96b9b54998af5"},{"end":320,"rank":3,"text":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart. Scope: release 1.8 only. A request may be attempted at most three times in total: the initial attempt and at most two retries. Only a transport timeout is retryable. HTTP 4xx responses are final and must not be retried. This document is not a policy for later major policy revisions.","score":1.7579468651,"start":0,"title":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart","source":"synthetic:alder/quickstart-1.8","chunk_id":"chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","bm25_score":1.7579468651,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"ar-legacy","content_sha256":"b3b63803a30a935fe32b8ed1501bc3e862a11ea127a1c690e36d5b01c15ea4cb"},{"end":368,"rank":4,"text":"Training slide 17 was labelled 'Alder Relay 2.4: three attempts everywhere'. Editorial correction dated 2028-02-10: the slide copied the old 1.8 quickstart and was never approved as the 2.4 retry policy. Do not use it to determine 2.4 defaults or a cluster's effective value. Use the approved 2.4 normative policy together with the signed fleet configuration register.","score":1.5766695476,"start":0,"title":"Unapproved Alder Relay training slide correction","source":"synthetic:alder/training-erratum","chunk_id":"chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","bm25_score":1.5766695476,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"ar-training","content_sha256":"d548c38d7d622c7dfb6623c8f5fd4452bb36a6dc1e9e8137521c6507bb78c186"}],"searches":[{"query":"Cedar 生产集群 Alder Relay 2.4 重试次数 超时 HTTP 4xx","top_k":5,"strategy":"bm25","chunk_ids":["chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:fdab8d6d8dc61ef206e038e5","chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8"],"transport":"loopback_http","snapshot_id":"0e75fb36-c33b-47dc-adbe-ae92434abba5:4","documents_sha256":"5b374c905dfd375db41b1df406efa5ce26e76c1ad2d1f524d7d5fe06b719b67c"}],"strategy":"bm25","chunk_count":4,"snapshot_id":"0e75fb36-c33b-47dc-adbe-ae92434abba5:4","document_count":4,"strategy_scope":"approved strategy; searches records actual model choices","documents_sha256":"5b374c905dfd375db41b1df406efa5ce26e76c1ad2d1f524d7d5fe06b719b67c"},"latency_ms":58179.505,"user_scope":{"authority":"user_provided_context_not_verified_evidence","precedence":"Current explicit corrections override saved focus and older messages. Saved fields are recorded inputs, not an assertion that they still apply.","saved_goal":"依据工作区资料判断指定版本和集群的重试规则，并保留版本适用范围。","saved_focus":"版本与部署适用范围","current_question":"请判断 Cedar 生产集群上的 Alder Relay 2.4：遇到传输超时最多能尝试几次，其中重试几次？HTTP 4xx 也会重试吗？培训材料写“2.4 一律三次”，请解释它与其他资料的冲突，并说明每个结论的依据。","saved_constraints":["用中文回答。","总尝试次数与重试次数分开表述。","不把用户提供的线索自动当作已核实的资料事实。"]},"assessments":[{"basis":"current_configuration","quotes":[{"quote":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"Cedar 生产集群上 Alder Relay 2.4 的总尝试次数为 2 次","explanation":"根据签名的集群配置注册表，Cedar 生产集群运行 Alder Relay 2.4，其 effective total_attempts=2，即最多尝试 2 次，包含初始尝试。","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"basis":"rule_evaluation","quotes":[{"quote":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"Cedar 生产集群上 Alder Relay 2.4 的重试次数为 1 次","explanation":"总尝试次数为 2 次，包含初始尝试，因此重试次数为 2 - 1 = 1 次。","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]},{"basis":"current_configuration","quotes":[{"quote":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"},{"quote":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy, approved 2028-02-04. The default total_attempts value is 1, including the initial attempt. A signed deployment configuration may override total_attempts to an integer from 1 to 4. Only a transport timeout is retryable; HTTP 4xx responses remain final and must not be retried. The deployment value takes precedence over this default. A retry allowance is a ceiling, not evidence that any request actually retried.","chunk_id":"chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"}],"verdict":"supported","statement":"Alder Relay 2.4 遇到传输超时最多尝试 2 次","explanation":"Cedar 集群的配置为 total_attempts=2，且仅传输超时可重试，因此传输超时最多尝试 2 次。","citation_ids":["chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","quotes":[{"quote":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy, approved 2028-02-04. The default total_attempts value is 1, including the initial attempt. A signed deployment configuration may override total_attempts to an integer from 1 to 4. Only a transport timeout is retryable; HTTP 4xx responses remain final and must not be retried. The deployment value takes precedence over this default. A retry allowance is a ceiling, not evidence that any request actually retried.","chunk_id":"chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"}],"verdict":"contradicted","statement":"Alder Relay 2.4 对 HTTP 4xx 响应进行重试","explanation":"Alder Relay 2.4 的规范重试策略明确指出 HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试。","citation_ids":["chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"]},{"basis":"documented_fact","quotes":[{"quote":"Training slide 17 was labelled 'Alder Relay 2.4: three attempts everywhere'. Editorial correction dated 2028-02-10: the slide copied the old 1.8 quickstart and was never approved as the 2.4 retry policy. Do not use it to determine 2.4 defaults or a cluster's effective value. Use the approved 2.4 normative policy together with the signed fleet configuration register.","chunk_id":"chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8"},{"quote":"Alder Relay 2.4 normative retry policy, approved 2028-02-04. The default total_attempts value is 1, including the initial attempt. A signed deployment configuration may override total_attempts to an integer from 1 to 4. Only a transport timeout is retryable; HTTP 4xx responses remain final and must not be retried. The deployment value takes precedence over this default. A retry allowance is a ceiling, not evidence that any request actually retried.","chunk_id":"chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd"},{"quote":"Signed fleet configuration register, captured 2028-02-12. Cedar production runs Alder Relay 2.4 with effective total_attempts=2. Juniper production remains on Alder Relay 1.8 with effective total_attempts=3. These are the complete current values for the two named clusters. This register records configured limits, not per-request execution history.","chunk_id":"chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"}],"verdict":"contradicted","statement":"培训材料中“2.4 一律三次”是准确的","explanation":"培训材料被明确标注为未批准且复制了旧版 1.8 内容，其“三次尝试”说法与 2.4 规范策略和 Cedar 集群实际配置冲突。","citation_ids":["chunk:fb1a34972964f841742388b8","chunk:e1d730dc775293a8cf97c0fd","chunk:1b137b99145d450cbee3b1fe"]}],"limitations":["The model chooses the tools and report assessments; semantic entailment is not independently verified.","Source labels are metadata; exact quote verification does not authenticate a source.","Time budgets stop further calls; in-flight provider requests cannot be forcibly cancelled."],"evidence_verdict":"contradicted","generation_review":{"calls":1,"delta":{"reviewed_response":{"assessments":[{"basis":"current_configuration","verdict":"supported","explanation":"根据签名的集群配置注册表，Cedar 生产集群运行 Alder Relay 2.4，其 effective total_attempts=2，即最多尝试 2 次，包含初始尝试。","evidence_ids":["pe2a396f909e83167"],"assessment_id":"a1"},{"basis":"rule_evaluation","verdict":"supported","explanation":"总尝试次数为 2 次，包含初始尝试，因此重试次数为 2 - 1 = 1 次。","evidence_ids":["pe2a396f909e83167"],"assessment_id":"a2"},{"basis":"current_configuration","verdict":"supported","explanation":"Cedar 集群的配置为 total_attempts=2，且仅传输超时可重试，因此传输超时最多尝试 2 次。","evidence_ids":["pe2a396f909e83167","p11e54de123e96be2"],"assessment_id":"a3"},{"basis":"documented_fact","verdict":"contradicted","explanation":"Alder Relay 2.4 的规范重试策略明确指出 HTTP 4xx 响应为最终状态，不得重试。","evidence_ids":["p11e54de123e96be2"],"assessment_id":"a4"},{"basis":"documented_fact","verdict":"contradicted","explanation":"培训材料被明确标注为未批准且复制了旧版 1.8 内容，其“三次尝试”说法与 2.4 规范策略和 Cedar 集群实际配置冲突。","evidence_ids":["p4fd32c80240892ee","p11e54de123e96be2","pe2a396f909e83167"],"assessment_id":"a5"}],"retained_assessment_ids":[]},"response_json_bytes":1416,"implementation_sha256":"5a6030a9c726e9b1ed26407abc408aededbed94dceca3a4457f195b871e00dab","replaced_assessment_ids":["a1","a2","a3","a4","a5"],"retained_assessment_ids":[],"semantic_correctness_verified":false},"model":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507","scope":"Same-provider model review followed by mechanical checks; not independent human review or p